            "notes": "\ud83e\udeb6 **Round 3** pick [Serenity](item_c6e1c072-ff50-467e-b59f-9506baea10c1) for more heal and use  [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) for more survivability.\n[Serenity](item_c6e1c072-ff50-467e-b59f-9506baea10c1) and [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) has a really nice synergy keep you alive while healing your team mates.\n\nRemove [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf), [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) and [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da).",
